    "detailed_description": "LUA is a vibrant rhythm-action game about skating to the beat of the music, where you will embark on an adventure and heal family conflicts through a musical journey.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2022440/extras/c5550c08263463d70250ea5c9bfbfb93.poster.avif?t=1724745076\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2022440/extras/c5550c08263463d70250ea5c9bfbfb93.webm?t=1724745076\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2022440/extras/c5550c08263463d70250ea5c9bfbfb93.mp4?t=1724745076\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Rhythm Skating:</strong> Skate to the beat in a one-of-a-kind game that blends the freedom of longboarding with the flow of music!<br></li><li><strong>Feel-Good OST:</strong> Get your spirits lifted with folk-rock tracks created by Gelpi.<br></li><li><strong>Emotional Journey:</strong> Dive into a heartwarming story about healing and family reconciliation.<br></li><li><strong>Connection with Nature</strong>: Explore a world where nature and humanity magically intertwine through gameplay, story, and fantastic characters.</li></ul><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2022440/extras/7e25d7ac673ee93f69a9c1201a6f9a58.poster.avif?t=1724745076\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2022440/extras/7e25d7ac673ee93f69a9c1201a6f9a58.webm?t=1724745076\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2022440/extras/7e25d7ac673ee93f69a9c1201a6f9a58.mp4?t=1724745076\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>This game is currently in development. If it\u2019s your kind of game, feel free to add it to your <strong>wishlist </strong>to show your support and <strong>join us on Discord</strong>! \ud83d\udc9c",
